    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "BACKGROUNDS"
            }
          ],
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 2,
            "endLine": 2,
            "startOffset": 6,
            "endOffset": 19
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Backgrounds allow you to customize your character based on their life before adventuring. This is the next step in their life story after their ancestry, which reflects the circumstances of their birth. Your character's background can help you learn or portray more about their personality while also suggesting what sorts of things they're likely to know. Consider what events set your character on their path to the life of an adventurer and how those circumstances relate to their background."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 4,
            "endLine": 4,
            "startOffset": 21,
            "endOffset": 516
          }
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 1,
        "endLine": 5,
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 518
      },
      "type": "head"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "At 1st level, when you create your character, you gain a background of your choice. This decision is permanent; you can’t change it at later levels. Each background listed here grants two boosts, a skill feat, and the trained proficiency rank in two skills, one of which is a Lore skill. If you gain the trained proficiency rank in a skill from your background and would then gain the trained proficiency rank in the same skill from your class at 1st level, you instead become trained in another skill of your choice."
        }
      ],
      "indent": "none",
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "endLine": 7,
        "startOffset": 520,
        "endOffset": 1037
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Lore skills represent deep knowledge of a specific subject and are described on page 240. If a Lore skill involves a choice (for instance, a choice of terrain), explain your preference to the GM, who has the final say on whether it’s acceptable or not. If you’d like some suggestions, the Common Lore Subcategories sidebar on page 240 lists a number of Lore skills that are suitable for most campaigns."
        }
      ],
      "indent": "first-line",
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "endLine": 9,
        "startOffset": 1039,
        "endOffset": 1441
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Skill feats expand the functions of your skills and appear in Chapter 5: Feats."
        }
      ],
      "indent": "first-line",
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "endLine": 11,
        "startOffset": 1443,
        "endOffset": 1522
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You spent your early days in a religious monastery or cloister. You may have traveled out into the world to spread the message of your religion or because you cast away the teachings of your faith, but deep down, you’ll always carry within you the lessons you learned."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 18,
            "endLine": 18,
            "startOffset": 1557,
            "endOffset": 1825
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom, and one is a free attribute boost."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 20,
            "endLine": 20,
            "startOffset": 1827,
            "endOffset": 1929
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You’re trained in the Religion skill and the Scribing Lore skill. You gain the Student of the Canon skill feat."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 22,
            "endLine": 22,
            "startOffset": 1931,
            "endOffset": 2042
          }
        }
      ],
      "name": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "ACOLYTE"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "endLine": 23,
        "startOffset": 1524,
        "endOffset": 2044
      },
      "subtitle": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BACKGROUND"
        }
      ],
      "traits": [],
      "type": "item"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "In a circus or on the streets, you earned your pay by performing as an acrobat. You might have turned to adventuring when the money dried up, or simply decided to put your skills to better use."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 30,
            "endLine": 30,
            "startOffset": 2079,
            "endOffset": 2272
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Dexterity, and one is a free attribute boost."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 32,
            "endLine": 32,
            "startOffset": 2274,
            "endOffset": 2375
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You’re trained in the Acrobatics skill and the Circus Lore skill. You gain the Steady Balance skill feat."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 34,
            "endLine": 34,
            "startOffset": 2377,
            "endOffset": 2482
          }
        }
      ],
      "name": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "ACROBAT"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 25,
        "endLine": 35,
        "startOffset": 2046,
        "endOffset": 2484
      },
      "subtitle": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BACKGROUND"
        }
      ],
      "traits": [],
      "type": "item"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You have always felt a connection to animals, and it was only a small leap to learn to train them. As you travel, you continuously encounter different creatures, befriending them along the way."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 42,
            "endLine": 42,
            "startOffset": 2528,
            "endOffset": 2721
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 44,
            "endLine": 44,
            "startOffset": 2723,
            "endOffset": 2821
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You’re trained in the Nature skill and a Lore skill related to one terrain inhabited by animals you like (such as Plains Lore or Swamp Lore). You gain the Train Animal skill feat."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 46,
            "endLine": 46,
            "startOffset": 2823,
            "endOffset": 3002
          }
        }
      ],
      "name": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "ANIMAL WHISPERER"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "endLine": 47,
        "startOffset": 2486,
        "endOffset": 3004
      },
      "subtitle": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BACKGROUND"
        }
      ],
      "traits": [],
      "type": "item"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "As an apprentice, you practiced a particular form of building or crafting, developing a specialized skill. You might have been a blacksmith’s apprentice toiling over the forge for countless hours, a young tailor sewing garments of all kinds, or a shipwright shaping the hulls of ships."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 54,
            "endLine": 54,
            "startOffset": 3039,
            "endOffset": 3324
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Intelligence, and one is a free attribute boost."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 56,
            "endLine": 56,
            "startOffset": 3326,
            "endOffset": 3430
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You’re trained in the Crafting skill and the Guild Lore skill. You gain the Specialty Crafting skill feat."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 58,
            "endLine": 58,
            "startOffset": 3432,
            "endOffset": 3538
          }
        }
      ],
      "name": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "ARTISAN"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 49,
        "endLine": 59,
        "startOffset": 3006,
        "endOffset": 3540
      },
      "subtitle": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BACKGROUND"
        }
      ],
      "traits": [],
      "type": "item"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Your art is your greatest passion, whatever form it takes. Adventuring might help you find inspiration, or simply be a way to survive until you become a world-famous artist."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 66,
            "endLine": 66,
            "startOffset": 3574,
            "endOffset": 3747
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 68,
            "endLine": 68,
            "startOffset": 3749,
            "endOffset": 3850
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You’re trained in the Crafting skill and the Art Lore skill. You gain the Specialty Crafting skill feat."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 70,
            "endLine": 70,
            "startOffset": 3852,
            "endOffset": 3956
          }
        }
      ],
      "name": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "ARTIST"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 61,
        "endLine": 71,
        "startOffset": 3542,
        "endOffset": 3958
      },
      "subtitle": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BACKGROUND"
        }
      ],
      "traits": [],
      "type": "item"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Your past includes no small amount of rural banditry, robbing travelers on the road and scraping by. Whether your robbery was sanctioned by a local noble or you did so of your own accord, you eventually got caught up in the adventuring life."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 78,
            "endLine": 78,
            "startOffset": 3992,
            "endOffset": 4233
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Choose two ability boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 80,
            "endLine": 80,
            "startOffset": 4235,
            "endOffset": 4334
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You’re trained in the Intimidation skill and a Lore skill related to the terrain you worked in (such as Desert Lore or Plains Lore). You gain the Group Coercion skill feat."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 82,
            "endLine": 82,
            "startOffset": 4336,
            "endOffset": 4508
          }
        }
      ],
      "name": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BANDIT"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "startLine": 73,
        "endLine": 83,
        "startOffset": 3960,
        "endOffset": 4510
      },
      "subtitle": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BACKGROUND"
        }
      ],
      "traits": [],
      "type": "item"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You have five specialties: hefting barrels, drinking, polishing steins, drinking, and drinking. You worked in a bar, where you learned how to hold your liquor and rowdily socialize."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "none",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 90,
            "endLine": 90,
            "startOffset": 4545,
            "endOffset": 4726
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 92,
            "endLine": 92,
            "startOffset": 4728,
            "endOffset": 4832
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "You’re trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Alcohol Lore skill. You gain the Hobnobber skill feat."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "first-line",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 94,
            "endLine": 94,
            "startOffset": 4834,
            "endOffset": 4934
          }
        }
      ],
      "name": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "BARKEEP"
        }
      ],
